   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution to ALNAP 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bi-annual commitment to ALNAP - Active Learning Network on Accountability and Performance, which funds part of the 2020-2021 and 2021-2022  ALNAP work plan, covering April 1, 2020 to March 31, 2022.
The strategic focus areas for ALNAP in this period are: 1) Creating a high-quality evidence base through evaluations; 2) Using evidence for analysis and learning,  and 3) improvements to the humanitarian system performance.</narrative>
